                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='13572' id='18' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='12357'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>** This dashboard is based on the sample data for 3 cities [RGN2 level], for ~5 days. Automation is expected by end-Feb 2025. **</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>UTR</run>
                  <run fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>is currently only measurable country-wide, as riders have activity across multiple zones (RGN2) within the same day. Applying any filter other than Date will make this metric Null. Consequently, this applies to </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Logistics Index</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> and </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Idle Time</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> as well.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>Questionable values to be reviwed in detail with Woowa: </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>UTR, Damage Rate, Idle Time, Reassignment Rate</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>To Vendor Time</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>is irrelevant given that riders can accept next delivery while ongoing deliveries are in progress. Consequently, </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Rider DT</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>excludes </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10' italic='true'>To Vendor Time</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>GMV, AOV, DF</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>are sourced from Coredata Business tables in Datahub</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10' italic='true'>CPO [Bonus]</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>includes promotions (equivalent to DH&apos;s quest payments).</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='68143' id='34' name='CPO vs Effort' w='98858' x='571' y='25929'>
